  (text "Positive current: bridge -> motor. Vout = I_MID + Iphase * 0.001 * 20.\nKeep force and Kelvin lands separate in copper. INA241 pin 4 connects to GND.\nInput capacitors DNP pending PWM settling validation; output RC provisional."
